`objectql.registerObject(SysView)` is not a method on the current ObjectQL engine. Register test schemas via the registry (`objectql.registry` / `SchemaRegistry`) using the supported registration method so that `insert/find/update/delete` can resolve `sys_view`.
```suggestion
    const registry = objectql.registry;
    registry.register(SysView);
```

Pagination options here use `offset`, but the DataEngine query options use `skip` (and `limit`). Using `offset` will be ignored by the current ObjectQL engine, so this test won’t actually validate pagination behavior.
